     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>(cc Ramnath, author of rCharts)</div><div><br></div>Can you try installing the latest Shiny changes (devtools::install_github(&quot;rstudio/shiny&quot;)) and see if you get a more useful stack trace?<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Mon, Nov 23, 2015 at 12:03 PM Dylan &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">djl...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I&#39;ve seen this issue discussed elsewhere but I was not able to correct my issue using the discussions in these locations:</div><div><ul><li><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topic/shiny-discuss/r-GXScCiGZ4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/forum/%23!topic/shiny-discuss/r-GXScCiGZ4&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792395932763000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3T9VsAnhBPUwd2K_Z8cF5l\">https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topic/shiny-discuss/r-GXScCiGZ4</a></span><br></li><li><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><a href=\"https://github.com/ramnathv/rCharts/issues/224\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/ramnathv/rCharts/issues/224&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792395932763000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2YqIdfKPTKB-bVxl7W228f\">https://github.com/ramnathv/rCharts/issues/224</a></span><br></li><li><span style=\"line-height:normal\"><a href=\"http://stackoverflow.com/questions/19121695/rcharts-with-highcharts-as-shiny-application\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://stackoverflow.com/questions/19121695/rcharts-with-highcharts-as-shiny-application&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792395932763000&amp;usg=AOvVaw19RpwJdH37HMrfLpGz8iZ2\">http://stackoverflow.com/questions/19121695/rcharts-with-highcharts-as-shiny-application</a></span><br></li></ul></div><div><br></div><div>Im not sure if this is a Shiny issue or an rCharts issue....</div><div><br></div><div>Here is my sessionInfo() :</div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">R version </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3.2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2015</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">08</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">14</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Platform</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x86_64</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">w64</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mingw32</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x64 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">64</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bit</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Running</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> under</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Windows</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> x64 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">build </span><span style=\"color:#066\">7601</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Service</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Pack</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span